10e année (Secondaire III)\"}, \"value\": \"grade_9_10\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Grade 11–12 (Secondaire IV–V)\", \"fr\": \"11e–12e année (Secondaire IV–V)\"}, \"value\": \"grade_11_12\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Secondary School Diploma or GED\", \"fr\": \"Diplôme d’études secondaires ou GED\"}, \"value\": \"secondary_school_diploma_or_ged\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Some post-secondary training\", \"fr\": \"Certaines formations postsecondaires\"}, \"value\": \"post_secondary_training\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Apprenticeship/trades certificate or diploma\", \"fr\": \"Certificat ou diplôme d\'apprentissage/métiers\"}, \"value\": \"apprenticeship_trades\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"CEGEP or other non-university certificate/diploma\", \"fr\": \"DEC ou autre certificat/diplôme non universitaire\"}, \"value\": \"cegep\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"College or other non-university certificate/diploma\", \"fr\": \"Certificat ou diplôme collégial ou autre certificat/diplôme non universitaire\"}, \"value\": \"college\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"University certificate or diploma\", \"fr\": \"Certificat ou diplôme universitaire\"}, \"value\": \"university_certificate\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"University – Bachelor Degree\", \"fr\": \"Université – Baccalauréat\"}, \"value\": \"bachelors_degree\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"University – Master’s Degree\", \"fr\": \"Université – Maîtrise\"}, \"value\": \"masters_degree\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"University – Doctorate\", \"fr\": \"Université – Doctorat\"}, \"value\": \"doctorate\"}], \"required\": true, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"example-radio-2\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true}, \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}, {\"id\": \"education-year\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Leave blank if you had no formal education\", \"fr\": \"Laissez vide si vous n’avez reçu aucune éducation formelle\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Year you completed your highest level of education\", \"fr\": \"Année à laquelle vous avez terminé votre plus haut niveau d’éducation\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"education-year\"}, {\"id\": \"education-location\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"If you completed your education outside Canada select \\\"other\\\"\", \"fr\": \"Si vous avez terminé vos études à l’extérieur du Canada, sélectionnez « autre »\"}, \"type\": \"select\", \"class\": \"govuk-select\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Province or territory where you completed your highest level of education\", \"fr\": \"Province ou territoire où vous avez terminé votre plus haut niveau d’éducation\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Alberta\", \"fr\": \"Alberta\"}, \"value\": \"ab\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"British Columbia\", \"fr\": \"Colombie-Britannique\"}, \"value\": \"bc\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Manitoba\", \"fr\": \"Manitoba\"}, \"value\": \"mb\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"New Brunswick\", \"fr\": \"Nouveau-Brunswick\"}, \"value\": \"nb\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Newfoundland and Labrador\", \"fr\": \"Terre-Neuve-et-Labrador\"}, \"value\": \"nl\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Nova Scotia\", \"fr\": \"Nouvelle-Écosse\"}, \"value\": \"ns\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Northwest Territories\", \"fr\": \"Territoires du Nord-Ouest\"}, \"value\": \"nt\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Nunavut\", \"fr\": \"Nunavut\"}, \"value\": \"nu\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Ontario\", \"fr\": \"Ontario\"}, \"value\": \"on\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Prince Edward Island\", \"fr\": \"Île-du-Prince-Édouard\"}, \"value\": \"pe\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Quebec\", \"fr\": \"Québec\"}, \"value\": \"qc\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Saskatchewan\", \"fr\": \"Saskatchewan\"}, \"value\": \"sk\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Yukon\", \"fr\": \"Yukon\"}, \"value\": \"yt\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Other\", \"fr\": \"Autre\"}, \"value\": \"other\"}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"storageKey\": \"education-location\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"employment-goals-and-barriers\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Employment Goals and Barriers\", \"fr\": \"Employment Goals and Barriers\"}, \"stepId\": \"employment-goals-and-barriers\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Employment Goals and Barriers\", \"fr\": \"Objectifs et obstacles liés à l\'emploi\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Help us understand your career goals and any challenges you\'re facing.\", \"fr\": \"Aidez-nous à comprendre vos objectifs de carrière et les défis auxquels vous faites face.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"long-term-goal\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Training and Employment Goal as it relates to ISET funding/support\", \"fr\": \"Objectif de formation et d\'emploi en lien avec le financement/le soutien de l\'ISET\"}, \"rows\": 5, \"type\": \"character-count\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What is your long-term goal?\", \"fr\": \"Quel est votre objectif à long terme ?\"}, \"required\": false, \"maxLength\": 500, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"threshold\": 75, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"long-term-goal\"}, {\"id\": \"barriers\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Select all that apply.\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez toutes les options applicables.\"}, \"name\": \"barriers\", \"type\": \"checkboxes\", \"class\": \"govuk-checkboxes\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What barriers are you currently facing?\", \"fr\": \"Quels obstacles rencontrez-vous actuellement ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Education\", \"fr\": \"Éducation\"}, \"value\": \"education\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Funding\", \"fr\": \"Financement\"}, \"value\": \"funding\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Lack of Job Opportunities\", \"fr\": \"Manque d\'opportunités d\'emploi\"}, \"value\": \"lack-of-job-opportunities\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Location\", \"fr\": \"Emplacement\"}, \"value\": \"location\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Other\", \"fr\": \"Autre\"}, \"value\": \"other\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"other-barrier\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Enter the requested value.\", \"fr\": \"Entrez la valeur demandée.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other barrier (please specify)\", \"fr\": \"Autre obstacle (veuillez préciser)\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"other-barrier\"}]}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"barriers\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}, {\"id\": \"target-program\", \"name\": \"target-program\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Have you already identified a training program or employer?\", \"fr\": \"Avez-vous déjà identifié un programme de formation ou un employeur ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Formal training such as college, university, or vocational courses that help you gain new skills or credentials.\", \"fr\": \"Formation formelle telle que collège, université ou cours professionnels qui vous aident à acquérir de nouvelles compétences ou qualifications.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Skills Development (Education)\", \"fr\": \"Développement des compétences (Éducation)\"}, \"value\": \"skills_development\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Support to help an employer hire you by covering part of your wages during a training or probation period.\", \"fr\": \"Soutien pour aider un employeur à vous embaucher en couvrant une partie de votre salaire durant une période de formation ou de probation.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Targeted Wage Subsidy\", \"fr\": \"Subvention salariale ciblée\"}, \"value\": \"tws\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Short-term work experience on a community or project-based initiative that builds your employability.\", \"fr\": \"Expérience de travail à court terme dans une initiative communautaire ou basée sur un projet qui développe votre employabilité.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Job Creation Partnership\", \"fr\": \"Partenariat de création d\'emploi\"}, \"value\": \"jcp\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Training delivered to a group of participants with similar learning goals, often led by an employer or community partner.\", \"fr\": \"Formation offerte à un groupe de participants ayant des objectifs d\'apprentissage similaires, souvent dirigée par un employeur ou un partenaire communautaire.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Group Training\", \"fr\": \"Formation en groupe\"}, \"value\": \"group\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Assistance to start or grow your own business, including business planning or mentorship.\", \"fr\": \"Assistance pour démarrer ou développer votre propre entreprise, incluant la planification d\'affaires ou le mentorat.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Self-employment Supports\", \"fr\": \"Soutien à l\'auto-entrepreneuriat\"}, \"value\": \"self_support\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"You have not yet chosen a specific program or employer.\", \"fr\": \"Vous n\'avez pas encore choisi de programme ou d\'employeur spécifique.\"}, \"label\": {\"en\": \"Not yet\", \"fr\": \"Pas encore\"}, \"value\": \"not_yet\"}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"target-program\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"financial-supports-requested\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Financial Supports Requested\", \"fr\": \"Financial Supports Requested\"}, \"stepId\": \"financial-supports-requested\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Financial Supports Requested\", \"fr\": \"Prêts financiers demandés\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Tell us what financial support you are requesting to help you reach your employment goal.\", \"fr\": \"Dites-nous quels prêts financiers vous demandez pour vous aider à atteindre votre objectif d\'emploi.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"requested-supports\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Select all that apply.\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez toutes les options applicables.\"}, \"name\": \"requested-supports\", \"type\": \"checkboxes\", \"class\": \"govuk-checkboxes\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Which of the following supports are you requesting?\", \"fr\": \"Quels sont les soutiens suivants que vous demandez ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Tuition\", \"fr\": \"Frais de scolarité\"}, \"value\": \"tuition\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Books or Program Materials\", \"fr\": \"Livres ou matériel de programme\"}, \"value\": \"books\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Living Allowance\", \"fr\": \"Allocation de subsistance\"}, \"value\": \"living\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Transportation\", \"fr\": \"Transport\"}, \"value\": \"transportation\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Other\", \"fr\": \"Autre\"}, \"value\": \"other\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"other-requested-support\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other support (please specify)\", \"fr\": \"Autre soutien (veuillez préciser)\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"other-requested-support\"}]}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"requested-supports\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}, {\"id\": \"disability-support\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Are you requesting specific funding to support you disability while attending a training/educational institution (such as an e-reader). You will need to identify what support you are requesting and will have to provide medical documentation indicating you have a disability and require the requested support.\", \"fr\": \"Demandez-vous un financement spécifique pour soutenir votre handicap pendant que vous fréquentez un établissement de formation ou d\'enseignement (comme un lecteur électronique) ? Vous devrez indiquer le soutien demandé et fournir une documentation médicale indiquant que vous avez un handicap et que vous avez besoin du soutien demandé.\"}, \"name\": \"disability-support\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Are you requesting support in relation to your disability?\", \"fr\": \"Demandez-vous un soutien en lien avec votre handicap ?\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Yes\", \"fr\": \"Oui\"}, \"value\": \"yes\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"disability-support-yes-follow\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Please tell us what support you are requesting in relation to your disability.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez nous indiquer le soutien que vous demandez en lien avec votre handicap.\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Requested support\", \"fr\": \"Requested support\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"disability-support_yes_follow\"}]}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"No\", \"fr\": \"Non\"}, \"value\": \"no\"}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"yn-01\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"has-disability\", \"value\": \"1\"}]}, \"storageKey\": \"disability-support\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--m\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"household-income\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Household Income\", \"fr\": \"Household Income\"}, \"stepId\": \"household-income\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Household Income\", \"fr\": \"Revenu du ménage\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Please disclose all sources of monthly household income. Documentation and proof of financial situation is required prior to any approval of funding.\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez divulguer toutes les sources de revenu mensuel du ménage. Une documentation et une preuve de la situation financière sont requises avant toute approbation de financement.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"income-employment\", \"mask\": \"currency\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Employment Income\", \"fr\": \"Revenu d\'emploi\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"storageKey\": \"income-employment\"}, {\"id\": \"income-spousal\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Spousal Income\", \"fr\": \"Revenu du conjoint\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"income-spousal\"}, {\"id\": \"income-social-assist\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Social Assistance\", \"fr\": \"Aide sociale\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"income-social-assist\"}, {\"id\": \"income-child-support\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Child Support\", \"fr\": \"Pension alimentaire pour enfants\"}, \"prefix\": {\"