avant toute approbation de financement.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"expenses-rent\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Rent/Mortgage\", \"fr\": \"Loyer/Hypothèque\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"storageKey\": \"expenses-rent\"}, {\"id\": \"expenses-groceries\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Groceries\", \"fr\": \"Épicerie\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"expenses-groceries\"}, {\"id\": \"expenses-utilities\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Utilities (Hydro, water, natural gas, sewer, garbage)\", \"fr\": \"Services publics (Hydro, eau, gaz naturel, égout, poubelle)\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"expenses-utilities\"}, {\"id\": \"expenses-transport\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Select only those that relate to the training\", \"fr\": \"Sélectionnez uniquement ceux qui concernent la formation\"}, \"name\": \"expenses_transport\", \"type\": \"checkboxes\", \"class\": \"govuk-checkboxes\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Transport Expenses\", \"fr\": \"Frais de transport\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"Bus Pass \", \"fr\": \"Passe de bus\"}, \"value\": \"buss_pass\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"expenses-bus-pass\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"For journeys to school\", \"fr\": \"Pour les trajets vers l\'école\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Bus Pass\", \"fr\": \"Passe d\'autobus\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"expenses_bus_pass\"}]}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Parking (at the school)\", \"fr\": \"Stationnement (à l\'école)\"}, \"value\": \"parking\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"expenses-parking\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Price of parking at the school\", \"fr\": \"Prix du stationnement à l\'école\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Parking Charges\", \"fr\": \"Frais de stationnement\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"expenses-parking\"}]}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"Mileage (home to school)\", \"fr\": \"Kilométrage (domicile-école)\"}, \"value\": \"mileage\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"expenses-transport-mileage\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"For the journeys between your home and school\", \"fr\": \"Pour les trajets entre votre domicile et l\'école\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Mileage\", \"fr\": \"Mileage\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"number\", \"normalize\": \"number\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"expenses_transport_mileage\"}]}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"expenses_transport\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\"}, {\"id\": \"expenses-other-list\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"List only expenses directly related to your training or education program. Personal or household expenses (such as car payments, credit card bills, or pet care) are not eligible.\", \"fr\": \"Indiquez uniquement les dépenses directement liées à votre programme de formation ou d’éducation. Les dépenses personnelles ou ménagères (comme les paiements de voiture, les factures de carte de crédit ou les soins pour animaux) ne sont pas admissibles.\"}, \"type\": \"textarea\", \"class\": \"govuk-textarea\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Additional Training-Related Expenses\", \"fr\": \"Dépenses supplémentaires liées à la formation\"}, \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"storageKey\": \"expenses-other-list\"}, {\"id\": \"example-input-5\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Please enter a total for the additional expenses\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez indiquer un total pour les dépenses supplémentaires\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other Expenses\", \"fr\": \"Autres dépenses\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"$\", \"fr\": \"$\"}}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"per month\", \"fr\": \"par mois\"}}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"example-input-5\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"summary-page\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Summary Page\", \"fr\": \"Summary Page\"}, \"stepId\": \"summary-page\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Review your application\", \"fr\": \"Passez en revue votre demande\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-m\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"This is the data you have entered.  Please take some time to review it and esure it is complete and accurate.\", \"fr\": \"Voici les données que vous avez saisies. Veuillez prendre un moment pour les revoir et vous assurer qu\'elles sont complètes et exactes.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"summary-list-2\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"social-insurance-number\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What is your Social Insurance Number (SIN)?\", \"fr\": \"Quel est votre numéro d\'assurance sociale (SIN) ?\"}}, {\"key\": \"first-name\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"First Name\", \"fr\": \"Premier Nom\"}}, {\"key\": \"last-name\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Last Name\", \"fr\": \"Nom de Famille\"}}, {\"key\": \"middle-names\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Middle Name(s)\", \"fr\": \"Nom de milieu(s)\"}}, {\"key\": \"preferred-name\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Preferred Name (if different)\", \"fr\": \"Nom préféré (si différent)\"}}, {\"key\": \"dob\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What is your date of birth?\", \"fr\": \"Entrez la date\"}}, {\"key\": \"conflict_of_interest\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What is your gender identity?\", \"fr\": \"What is your gender identity?\"}, \"originalKey\": \"example-radio\"}, {\"key\": \"visible-minority\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Visible Minority?\", \"fr\": \"Visible Minority?\"}}, {\"key\": \"marital-status\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Marital Status\", \"fr\": \"Marital Status\"}}, {\"key\": \"spouses-name\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Spouse\'s Name\", \"fr\": \"Spouse\'s Name\"}}, {\"key\": \"dependent-children\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Do you have dependent children?\", \"fr\": \"Do you have dependent children?\"}}, {\"key\": \"ages-of-children\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Ages of Children\", \"fr\": \"Ages of Children\"}}, {\"key\": \"has-disability\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Do you consider yourself to have a disability?\", \"fr\": \"Est-ce que vous considérez avoir un handicap ?\"}}, {\"key\": \"social-assistance\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Are you currently receiving social assistance?\", \"fr\": \"Est-ce que vous recevez actuellement de l\'aide sociale ?\"}}, {\"key\": \"top-up-amount\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"what is your allowable top-up amount (if applicable)\", \"fr\": \"Quelle est votre montant d\'allowance maximale (si applicable)\"}}, {\"key\": \"labour-force-status\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What is your current labour force status?\", \"fr\": \"What is your current labour force status?\"}}, {\"key\": \"gender_identity\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What highest level of education did you complete?\", \"fr\": \"What highest level of education did you complete?\"}, \"originalKey\": \"example-radio-2\"}, {\"key\": \"education-year\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Year you completed your highest level of education\", \"fr\": \"Year you completed your highest level of education\"}}, {\"key\": \"edication-location\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Province, territory or country where you completed your highest level of education\", \"fr\": \"Province, territory or country where you completed your highest level of education\"}}], \"type\": \"summary-list\", \"hideEmpty\": true, \"emptyFallback\": {\"en\": \"Not provided\", \"fr\": \"Non fourni\"}}, {\"id\": \"summary-list-3\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"address-street-address\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Street Address\", \"fr\": \"Street Address\"}, \"originalKey\": \"street-address\"}, {\"key\": \"address-city\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"City\", \"fr\": \"City\"}}, {\"key\": \"address-postcode\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Postal Code\", \"fr\": \"Postal Code\"}}, {\"key\": \"address-mailing-address\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Mailing Address (if different)\", \"fr\": \"Champ multi-lignes\"}}, {\"key\": \"telephone-day\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Daytime Phone Number\", \"fr\": \"Daytime Phone Number\"}}, {\"key\": \"telephone-alt\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Alternative Phone Number (optional)\", \"fr\": \"Alternative Phone Number (optional)\"}, \"originalKey\": \"example-input-5\"}, {\"key\": \"contact-email-address\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Email Address\", \"fr\": \"Email Address\"}, \"originalKey\": \"example-input-6\"}, {\"key\": \"education-location\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Province or Territory\", \"fr\": \"Province or Territory\"}, \"originalKey\": \"example-select\"}, {\"key\": \"telephone-alt\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Alternative Phone Number (optional)\", \"fr\": \"Alternative Phone Number (optional)\"}}, {\"key\": \"emergency-contact-name\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Emergency Contact Name\", \"fr\": \"Emergency Contact Name\"}}, {\"key\": \"emergency-contact-telephone\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Emergency Contact Phone Number\", \"fr\": \"Emergency Contact Phone Number\"}}, {\"key\": \"emergency-contact-relationship\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Relationship to You\", \"fr\": \"Relationship to You\"}}], \"type\": \"summary-list\", \"hideEmpty\": true, \"emptyFallback\": {\"en\": \"Not provided\", \"fr\": \"Non fourni\"}}, {\"id\": \"summary-list-4\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"conflict_of_interest\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What is your gender identity?\", \"fr\": \"What is your gender identity?\"}, \"originalKey\": \"example-radio\"}, {\"key\": \"registration-number\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What is your registration number?\", \"fr\": \"What is your registration number?\"}}, {\"key\": \"home-comminuty\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What is your home community?\", \"fr\": \"What is your home community?\"}}], \"type\": \"summary-list\", \"hideEmpty\": true, \"emptyFallback\": {\"en\": \"Not provided\", \"fr\": \"Non fourni\"}}, {\"id\": \"summary-list-5\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"barriers\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What barriers are you currently facing?\", \"fr\": \"What barriers are you currently facing?\"}}, {\"key\": \"other-barrier\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other barrier (please specify)\", \"fr\": \"Other barrier (please specify)\"}}, {\"key\": \"target-program\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Have you already identified a training program or employer?\", \"fr\": \"Have you already identified a training program or employer?\"}}, {\"key\": \"requested-supports\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Which of the following supports are you requesting?\", \"fr\": \"Which of the following supports are you requesting?\"}}, {\"key\": \"other-requested-support\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other support (please specify)\", \"fr\": \"Other support (please specify)\"}}], \"type\": \"summary-list\", \"hideEmpty\": true, \"emptyFallback\": {\"en\": \"Not provided\", \"fr\": \"Non fourni\"}}, {\"id\": \"summary-list-6\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"income-employment\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Employment Income\", \"fr\": \"Employment Income\"}}, {\"key\": \"income-spousal\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Spousal Income\", \"fr\": \"Spousal Income\"}}, {\"key\": \"income-social-assist\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Social Assistance\", \"fr\": \"Social Assistance\"}}, {\"key\": \"income-child-benefit\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Child Tax Benefit\", \"fr\": \"Child Tax Benefit\"}}, {\"key\": \"income-jordans\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Jordan’s Principle\", \"fr\": \"Jordan’s Principle\"}}, {\"key\": \"income-band-funding\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Band Funding\", \"fr\": \"Band Funding\"}}, {\"key\": \"income-other\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other Income (if applicable)\", \"fr\": \"Other Income (if applicable)\"}}, {\"key\": \"income-other-description\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other Income\", \"fr\": \"Other Income\"}}], \"type\": \"summary-list\", \"hideEmpty\": true, \"emptyFallback\": {\"en\": \"Not provided\", \"fr\": \"Non fourni\"}}, {\"id\": \"summary-list-7\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"expenses-rent\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Rent/Mortgage\", \"fr\": \"Rent/Mortgage\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-utilities\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Utilities (Hydro, water, natural gas, sewer, garbage, internet)\", \"fr\": \"Utilities (Hydro, water, natural gas, sewer, garbage, internet)\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-groceries\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Groceries\", \"fr\": \"Groceries\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-transitpass\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Transit Pass\", \"fr\": \"Transit Pass\"}}, {\"key\": \"expenses-other-list\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other Expenses\", \"fr\": \"Champ multi-lignes\"}}, {\"key\": \"telephone-alt\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Other Expenses\", \"fr\": \"Other Expenses\"}, \"originalKey\": \"example-input-5\"}], \"type\": \"summary-list\", \"hideEmpty\": true, \"emptyFallback\": {\"en\": \"Not provided\", \"fr\": \"Non fourni\"}}], \"nextStepId\": \"iset-document-upload\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"ISET Document Upload\", \"fr\": \"ISET Document Upload\"}, \"stepId\": \"iset-document-upload\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Document Upload\", \"fr\": \"Téléchargement de document\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Based on your answers the following documents must be submitted in support of your application.\", \"fr\": \"Sur la base de vos réponses, les documents suivants doivent être soumis à l\'appui de votre demande.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"status-card\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Always required; base identity/eligibility proof\", \"fr\": \"Toujours requis; preuve d\'identité/éligibilité de base\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Status/Treaty Card (or equivalent)\", \"fr\": \"Statut/Carte de traité (ou équivalent)\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": false, \"required\": false, \"maxSizeMb\": 1, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"status-card\", \"showMaxSize\": true, \"showMimeList\": false}, {\"id\": \"govt-id\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Always required as a secondary identity document\", \"fr\": \"Toujours requis comme document d\'identité secondaire\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Government-Issued ID\", \"fr\": \"Pièce d\'identité délivrée par le gouvernement\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": false, \"required\": false, \"maxSizeMb\": 1, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"govt-id\", \"showMaxSize\": true, \"showMimeList\": false}, {\"id\": \"acceptance-letter\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"You indicated that you have been accepted into a skills development or training program.  Please upload you letter of acceptance into that program.\", \"fr\": \"Vous avez indiqué que vous avez été accepté dans un programme de développement des compétences ou de formation. Veuillez télécharger votre lettre d\'acceptation dans ce programme.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Letter of Acceptance\", \"fr\": \"Lettre d\'acceptation\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": false, \"required\": false, \"maxSizeMb\": 3, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"target-program\", \"value\": \"Yes\"}, {\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"target-program\", \"value\": \"skills_development\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"acceptance-letter\", \"showMaxSize\": true, \"showMimeList\": false}, {\"id\": \"applicant-pay-stubs\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"You indicated that you have a salaried income.  Please upload your last three-months\' pay stubs.\", \"fr\": \"Vous avez indiqué que vous avez un revenu salarial. Veuillez télécharger vos trois derniers bulletins de paie.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Pay Stubs (Applicant)\", \"fr\": \"Bulletins de paie (demandeur)\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": false, \"maxSizeMb\": 6, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \">\", \"ref\": \"income-employment\", \"value\": \"0\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"applicant-pay-stubs\", \"showMaxSize\": true, \"showMimeList\": false}, {\"id\": \"spouse-pay-stubs\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"You indicated that you are married, and that your spouse has an income.  Please upload your spouse\'s last three-months\' pay stubs.\", \"fr\": \"Vous avez indiqué que vous êtes marié et que votre conjoint a un revenu. Veuillez télécharger les trois derniers bulletins de paie de votre conjoint.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Pay Stubs (Spouse)\", \"fr\": \"Bulletins de paie (conjoint)\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": false, \"maxSizeMb\": 6, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"equals\", \"ref\": \"marital-status\", \"value\": \"married\"}, {\"op\": \">\", \"ref\": \"income-spousal\", \"value\": \"0\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"spouse-pay-stubs\", \"showMaxSize\": true, \"showMimeList\": false}, {\"id\": \"band-denial-letter\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"You did not include any band funding in your declared income.  Please attache any letter denying you band funding in assoication with this application\", \"fr\": \"Vous n\'avez pas inclus de financement de bande dans votre revenu déclaré. Veuillez joindre toute lettre refusant votre financement de bande en association avec cette demande.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Band Denial Letter\", \"fr\": \"Lettre de refus de financement de bande\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": false, \"required\": false, \"maxSizeMb\": 3, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"notExists\", \"ref\": \"income-band-funding\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"band-denial-letter\", \"showMaxSize\": true, \"showMimeList\": false}, {\"id\": \"band-funding-letter\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Youi listed band funding in your declared income.  Please attach the letter approving that funding, if you have it.\", \"fr\": \"Vous avez inscrit un financement de bande dans votre revenu déclaré. Veuillez joindre la lettre approuvant ce financement, si vous l\'avez.\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Band Funding Letter\", \"fr\": \"Lettre de financement de bande\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": false, \"required\": false, \"maxSizeMb\": 3, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"exists\", \"ref\": \"income-band-funding\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"band-funding-letter\", \"showMaxSize\": false, \"showMimeList\": false}, {\"id\": \"medical-documents\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"You indicated that you are requesting support in relation to a disability.  Please provide medical documentation indicating you have a disability and require the requested support.\", \"fr\": \"Ceci est le texte d\'aide pour le téléversement\"}, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Medical Documentation\", \"fr\": \"Téléversez un fichier\"}, \"accept\": \".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,.heic\", \"disabled\": false, \"multiple\": true, \"required\": false, \"maxSizeMb\": 10, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"conditions\": {\"all\": [{\"op\": \"exists\", \"ref\": \"disability-support_yes_follow\"}]}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"medical-documents\", \"showMaxSize\": false, \"showMimeList\": false}], \"nextStepId\": \"legal-and-submission\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Legal and Submission\", \"fr\": \"Legal and Submission\"}, \"stepId\": \"legal-and-submission\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Submission\", \"fr\": \"Soumission\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"You are now ready to submit your application. Please read the following legal declaration carfully and indicate that your acceptance with a signature below.   When you hit submit the application will be sent to NWAC and you will recieve a confimation email detailing next steps.   You can sign back into your dashbaord to check status and contact the case-workers.\", \"fr\": \"Vous êtes maintenant prêt à soumettre votre demande. Veuillez lire attentivement la déclaration légale suivante et indiquer votre acceptation par une signature ci-dessous. Lorsque vous appuierez sur soumettre, la demande sera envoyée à l\'ANFNC et vous recevrez un courriel de confirmation détaillant les prochaines étapes. Vous pouvez vous reconnecter à votre tableau de bord pour vérifier le statut et contacter les intervenants.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-hint\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-3\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I, the undersigned, give my expressed and informed consent to the Native Women’s Association of Canada and/or its sub-agreement holders to the Indigenous Skills and Employment Training Program (hereinafter referred to as ISET), to collect personal or sensitive information as it relates to my request for funding under the ISET program funded by Employment and Social Development Canada (ESDC). My consent extends to providing my Social Insurance Number (SIN), to determine my eligibility for interventions such as skills training and wage subsidies as part of the Labour Market Development Agreements (LMDA) program.\", \"fr\": \"Je, le soussigné, donne mon consentement exprimé et éclairé à l’Association des femmes autochtones du Canada et/ou à ses titulaires de sous-accords du Programme de formation et de perfectionnement des compétences autochtones (ci-après dénommé ISET), pour recueillir des renseignements personnels ou sensibles en lien avec ma demande de financement dans le cadre du programme ISET financé par Emploi et Développement social Canada (EDSC). Mon consentement s’étend à la fourniture de mon numéro d’assurance sociale (NAS), afin de déterminer mon admissibilité à des interventions telles que la formation professionnelle et les subventions salariales dans le cadre du programme des ententes de développement du marché du travail (EDMT).\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-4\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I acknowledge that the information is collected and administered in accordance with the Privacy Act (R.S.C. 1985, c P-21), the Department Employment and Social Development Canada Act (S.C. 2005, c.34), and the Access to Information Act (R.S.C., 1985, c.A-1). Information collected is to be used to determine eligibility for the ISET program; to measure results of this Agreement and evaluate its success; evaluate the effectiveness of the Program in achieving its objective; and, to meet its obligations of accountability by reporting on the results of the Program.\", \"fr\": \"Je reconnais que les renseignements sont recueillis et administrés conformément à la Loi sur la protection des renseignements personnels (L.R.C. 1985, ch. P-21), la Loi sur le ministère de l’Emploi et du Développement social Canada (L.C. 2005, ch. 34) et la Loi sur l’accès à l’information (L.R.C., 1985, ch. A-1). Les renseignements recueillis serviront à déterminer l’admissibilité au programme ISET; à mesurer les résultats de la présente entente et à en évaluer le succès; à évaluer l’efficacité du programme dans l’atteinte de ses objectifs; et à remplir ses obligations de reddition de comptes en faisant rapport des résultats du programme.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-5\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"All information referred to above shall be treated as confidential, and the Native Women’s Association of Canada and its sub-agreement holders will take all security measures reasonably necessary for the protection of such information against unauthorized release or disclosure.\", \"fr\": \"Tous les renseignements mentionnés ci-dessus seront traités de manière confidentielle, et l’Association des femmes autochtones du Canada ainsi que ses titulaires de sous-accords prendront toutes les mesures de sécurité raisonnablement nécessaires pour protéger ces renseignements contre toute diffusion ou divulgation non autorisée.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-6\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I understand that my personal information shall not be used or disclosed for purposes other than those for which it was collected, except with the expressed consent of you, as the client, or as required by law. Personal information shall be retained only as long as necessary for the fulfilment of those purposes.\", \"fr\": \"Je comprends que mes renseignements personnels ne seront pas utilisés ou divulgués à d’autres fins que celles pour lesquelles ils ont été recueillis, sauf avec mon consentement exprès, en tant que client, ou si la loi l’exige. Les renseignements personnels ne seront conservés que pour la durée nécessaire à la réalisation de ces fins.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-7\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I understand that the funding opportunity for which I am being considered is intended to increase Indigenous participation in the Canadian labour market and support First Nations, Metis and Inuit peoples’ access to sustainable and meaningful employment; and, provides access to training and employment supports to all Indigenous women in all their gender diversity, in Canada including status and non-status First Nations, Metis and Inuit peoples whether residing on or off-reserve, in urban centres and in rural, remote communities.\", \"fr\": \"Je comprends que l’occasion de financement pour laquelle je suis considéré vise à accroître la participation des Autochtones au marché du travail canadien et à soutenir l’accès des Premières Nations, des Métis et des Inuits à un emploi durable et significatif; et qu’elle offre un accès à la formation et aux soutiens à l’emploi à toutes les femmes autochtones dans toute leur diversité de genre, au Canada, y compris les membres des Premières Nations avec ou sans statut, les Métis et les Inuits, qu’elles résident dans des réserves, des centres urbains ou des collectivités rurales et éloignées.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-8\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I understand that providing false or misleading information and/or omission of information by me about my Indigenous identity may result in an investigation and if the investigation is founded, will be grounds for immediate suspension of any funding and further, revocation of any Funding Agreement between me and the Native Women’s Association of Canada and/or its sub-agreement holders, and will result in a repayment of funds to Employment and Social Development Canada (ESDC), for monies I received to which I was not entitled.\", \"fr\": \"Je comprends que la fourniture de renseignements faux ou trompeurs et/ou l’omission de renseignements par moi concernant mon identité autochtone peut entraîner une enquête et, si l’enquête est fondée, constitueront un motif de suspension immédiate de tout financement et, de plus, de révocation de toute entente de financement entre moi et l’Association des femmes autochtones du Canada et/ou ses titulaires de sous-accords, et entraîneront le remboursement des fonds à Emploi et Développement social Canada (EDSC), pour les montants que j’ai reçus et auxquels je n’avais pas droit.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-9\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I declare that I am an Indigenous person according to the following definition: Indigenous Peoples are people who are First Nations, Inuit or Métis.\", \"fr\": \"Je déclare que je suis une personne autochtone selon la définition suivante : Les peuples autochtones sont les personnes qui sont Premières Nations, Inuits ou Métis.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"applicant-signature\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Enter your full legal name then press Sign.\", \"fr\": \"Entrez votre nom légal complet, puis appuyez sur Signer.\"}, \"type\": \"signature-ack\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Type your full name to sign\", \"fr\": \"Tapez votre nom complet pour signer\"}, \"required\": true, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"boxPadding\": \"m\", \"clearLabel\": {\"en\": \"Clear\", \"fr\": \"Effacer\"}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"applicant_signature\", \"actionLabel\": {\"en\": \"Sign Now\", \"fr\": \"Signer maintenant\"}, \"placeholder\": {\"en\": \"First Last\", \"fr\": \"Prénom Nom\"}, \"handwritingFont\": \"cursive\", \"statusSignedText\": {\"en\": \"Signed\", \"fr\": \"Signé\"}, \"statusUnsignedText\": {\"en\": \"Not signed\", \"fr\": \"Non signé\"}}], \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}], \"version\": \"2025-11-06T15:07:00.297Z#21\", \"checksum\": \"4f5c00671c0bb3f4d7025259ff18940eb7a6bda18a2e74994f94c0ac1c2ca4e8\", \"publishedAt\": \"2025-11-06T15:07:00.297Z\", \"publishedBy\": {\"id\": null, \"name\": null, \"email\": null}, \"schemaEnvelope\": {\"raw\": {\"usedTemplateIds\": {}}, \"meta\": {\"counts\": {\"steps\": 22, \"components\": 123}, \"workflow\": {\"id\": 21, \"name\": \"ISET Intake Testing\", \"status\": \"active\"}, \"templates\": [{\"id\": 29, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"count\": 50, \"version\": 1, \"template_key\": \"text-block\"}, {\"id\": 35, \"type\": \"signature-ack\", \"count\": 4, \"version\": 1, \"template_key\": \"signature-ack\"}, {\"id\": 26, \"type\": \"input\", \"count\": 41, \"version\": 1, \"template_key\": \"input\"}, {\"id\": 1, \"type\": \"radio\", \"count\": 14, \"version\": 1, \"template_key\": \"radio\"}, {\"id\": 32, \"type\": \"textarea\", \"count\": 3, \"version\": 1, \"template_key\": \"textarea\"}, {\"id\": 13, \"type\": \"date-input\", \"count\": 1, \"version\": 1, \"template_key\": \"date-input\"}, {\"id\": 2, \"type\": \"select\", \"count\": 2, \"version\": 1, \"template_key\": \"select\"}, {\"id\": 31, \"type\": \"character-count\", \"count\": 2, \"version\": 1, \"template_key\": \"character-count\"}, {\"id\": 33, \"type\": \"checkbox\", \"count\": 3, \"version\": 1, \"template_key\": \"checkbox\"}, {\"id\": 24, \"type\": \"summary-list\", \"count\": 6, \"version\": 1, \"template_key\": \"summary-list\"}, {\"id\": 19, \"type\": \"file-upload\", \"count\": 8, \"version\": 1, \"template_key\": \"file-upload\"}], \"generatedAt\": \"2025-11-06T15:07:00.296Z\", \"schemaVersion\": \"1.1\"}, \"steps\": [{\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Consent\", \"fr\": \"Consent\"}, \"stepId\": \"consent\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Consent Form\", \"fr\": \"Formulaire de consentement\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I, the undersigned, give my expressed and informed consent to the Native Women’s Association of Canada and/or its sub-agreement holders to the Indigenous Skills and Employment Training Program (hereinafter referred to as ISET), to collect personal or sensitive information as it relates to my request for funding under the ISET program funded by Employment and Social Development Canada (ESDC). My consent extends to providing my Social Insurance Number (SIN), to determine my eligibility for interventions such as skills training and wage subsidies as part of the Labour Market Development Agreements (LMDA) program.\", \"fr\": \"\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-3\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I acknowledge that the information is collected and administered in accordance with the Privacy Act (R.S.C. 1985, c P-21), the Department Employment and Social Development Canada Act (S.C. 2005, c.34), and and the Access to Information Act (R.S.C., 1985, c.A-1). Information collected is to be used to determine eligibility for the ISET program; to measure results of this Agreement and evaluate its success; evaluate the effectiveness of the Program in achieving its objective; and, to meet its obligations of accountability by reporting on the results of the Program.\", \"fr\": \"Je reconnais que l\'information est collectée et gérée en vertu de la Loi sur la vie privée (R.S.C. 1985, c P-21), de la Loi sur le ministère de l\'emploi et du développement social du Canada (S.C. 2005, c.34), et de la Loi sur l\'accès à l\'information (R.S.C., 1985, c.A-1). L\'information est destinée à déterminer la qualification à ISET; à mesurer les résultats de ce contrat et à évaluer son succès; évaluer l\'efficacité du Programme dans atteinte de son objectif; et, à satisfaire ses obligations d\'accountabilité en rapportant les résultats du Programme.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-4\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"All information referred to above shall be treated as confidential, and the Native Women’s Association of Canada and its sub-agreement holders will take all security measures reasonably necessary for the protection of such information against unauthorized release or disclosure.\", \"fr\": \"Toute information mentionnée ci-dessus sera traitée comme confidentielle, et l\'Association des femmes autochtones du Canada et ses titulaires de sous-conventions prendront toutes mesures de sécurité raisonnables nécessaires pour la protection de cette information contre une divulgation ou une révélation non autorisée.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-5\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Further, I understand that my personal information shall not be used or disclosed for purposes other than those for which it was collected, except with the expressed consent of you, as the client, or as required by law. Personal information shall be retained only as long as necessary for the fulfilment of those purposes.\", \"fr\": \"Exemple de texte\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"consent\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"I confirm that I have read and understood the above consent and agree to proceed with my application.\", \"fr\": \"Je confirme avoir lu et compris le consentement ci-dessus et j\'accepte de poursuivre ma demande.\"}, \"type\": \"signature-ack\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Sign Here\", \"fr\": \"Signer avant de procéder\"}, \"required\": true, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"boxPadding\": \"m\", \"clearLabel\": {\"en\": \"Clear\", \"fr\": \"Effacer\"}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"consent\", \"actionLabel\": {\"en\": \"Sign Now\", \"fr\": \"Signer Maintenant\"}, \"placeholder\": {\"en\": \"First Name Last Name\", \"fr\": \"Prénom Nom\"}, \"handwritingFont\": \"cursive\", \"statusSignedText\": {\"en\": \"Signed\", \"fr\": \"Signé\"}, \"statusUnsignedText\": {\"en\": \"Unsigned\", \"fr\": \"Non signé\"}}], \"nextStepId\": \"indigenous-declaration\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Indigenous Declaration\", \"fr\": \"Indigenous Declaration\"}, \"stepId\": \"indigenous-declaration\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Indigenous Declaration\", \"fr\": \"Déclaration autochtone\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I, the undersigned, understand that the funding opportunity under the Indigenous Skills and Employment Training (ISET) program for which I am being assessed is intended to increase Indigenous participation in the Canadian labour market and support First Nations, Metis and Inuit peoples’ access to sustainable and meaningful employment. The ISET program provides access to training and employment supports to eligible Canadian Indigenous women in their diversities, including status and non-status First Nations, Metis and Inuit peoples whether residing on or off-reserve, in urban centres and in rural, remote communities.\", \"fr\": \"Je, le soussigné, comprends que l’opportunité de financement dans le cadre du programme de formation en compétences et emploi pour les Autochtones (FCEA) pour laquelle je suis évalué vise à augmenter la participation des Autochtones sur le marché du travail canadien et à soutenir l\'accès des Premières Nations, des Métis et des Inuits à un emploi durable et significatif. Le programme FCEA offre un accès à la formation et à un soutien à l’emploi aux femmes autochtones canadiennes admissibles dans leur diversité, y compris aux Premières Nations avec et sans statut, aux Métis et aux Inuits, qu’elles résident dans des réserves ou hors réserve, dans des centres urbains ou dans des collectivités rurales ou éloignées.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-3\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Further, I understand that providing false or misleading information and/or omission of information by me about my Indigenous identity may result in an investigation. If an investigation is founded, it will be grounds for immediate suspension of any funding provided or promised to me and further, revocation of any Funding Agreement signed between me and the Native Women’s Association of Canada and/or its sub-agreement holders, and will result in a repayment of funds to Employment and Social Development Canada (ESDC), for monies I received to which I was not entitled.\", \"fr\": \"De plus, je comprends que fournir des informations fausses ou trompeuses et/ou omettre des informations concernant mon identité autochtone peut entraîner une enquête. Si une enquête donne lieu à des constatations, cela constituera un motif de suspension immédiate de tout financement qui m’a été accordé ou promis et, en outre, la révocation de toute entente de financement signée entre moi et l’Association des femmes autochtones du Canada et/ou ses titulaires de sous-entente, et entraînera le remboursement de fonds à Emploi et Développement social Canada (EDSC) pour des sommes reçues auxquelles je n’avais pas droit.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"indigenous-affiliation-declaration\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"(e.g., Mohawk of Kahnawà:ke ; Inuit of Nunatsiavut; Metis Nation of  Alberta, Region 3, etc.)\", \"fr\": \"(p. ex., Mohawk de Kahnawa:ke; Inuit de Nunatsiavut; Nation métisse de l’Alberta, région 3, etc.)\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"My Nation/Community/Treaty Area affiliation\", \"fr\": \"Affiliation à ma nation/communauté/territoire de traité\"}, \"required\": true, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"storageKey\": \"indigenous-affiliation-declaration\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please enter your affiliation\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez indiquer votre affiliation\"}}}, {\"id\": \"indigenous-declaration\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"I hereby declare that I am an Indigenous person in Canada, which for the purposes of the Indigenous Skills and Employment Training (ISET) Program is inclusive of persons who are First Nations, Inuit, or Metis.\", \"fr\": \"Je déclare par la présente que je suis une personne autochtone au Canada, ce qui, pour les fins du programme de formation en compétences et emploi pour les Autochtones (FCEA), inclut les personnes qui sont Premières Nations, Inuits ou Métis.\"}, \"type\": \"signature-ack\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Declaration\", \"fr\": \"Déclaration\"}, \"required\": true, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"boxPadding\": \"m\", \"clearLabel\": {\"en\": \"Clear\", \"fr\": \"Effacer\"}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"indigenous_declaration\", \"actionLabel\": {\"en\": \"Sign Now\", \"fr\": \"Signer maintenant\"}, \"placeholder\": {\"en\": \"First Last\", \"fr\": \"Prénom Nom\"}, \"handwritingFont\": \"cursive\", \"statusSignedText\": {\"en\": \"Signed\", \"fr\": \"Signé\"}, \"statusUnsignedText\": {\"en\": \"Not signed\", \"fr\": \"Non signé\"}}], \"nextStepId\": \"conflict-of-interest\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Conflict of Interest\", \"fr\": \"Conflict of Interest\"}, \"stepId\": \"conflict-of-interest\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Conflict of Interest and Bias Declaration\", \"fr\": \"Déclaration de conflit d’intérêts et de partialité\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"The Indigenous Skills and Employment Training (ISET) program is committed to fairness, transparency, and accountability in all funding decisions.\", \"fr\": \"Le programme de formation aux compétences et à l’emploi des Autochtones (PTCEA) s’engage à assurer l’équité, la transparence et la responsabilité dans toutes les décisions de financement.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-3\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"To protect the integrity of the program, all applicants must declare any actual, potential, or perceived conflicts of interest or biases related to their ISET application.\", \"fr\": \"Pour protéger l’intégrité du programme, tous les candidats doivent déclarer tout conflit d’intérêts ou biais réels, potentiels ou perçus liés à leur demande dans le cadre du PTCEA.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-4\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"1.      I do not have any personal, family, financial, or other relationship with any staff member of the Native Women’s Association of Canada (NWAC) or any regional Provincial/Territorial Member Association (PTMA) that could influence or appear to influence the assessment or approval of my ISET application.\", \"fr\": \"1.      Je n’ai aucune relation personnelle, familiale, financière ou autre avec un membre du personnel de l’Association des femmes autochtones du Canada (AFAC) ou de toute association régionale provinciale/territoriale (ARPT) qui pourrait influencer ou sembler influencer l’évaluation ou l’approbation de ma demande PTCEA.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-5\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"2.      I have not attempted to influence or put pressure on any NWAC or regional PTMA staff involved in assessing or approving my ISET application.\", \"fr\": \"2.      Je n’ai pas tenté d’influencer ou de faire pression sur un membre du personnel de l’AFAC ou de l’ARPT impliqué dans l’évaluation ou l’approbation de ma demande PTCEA.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-6\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"3.      I have not requested that my application be given priority ahead of other applicants, as I understand my application will be assessed in the order in which it was received by NWAC and/or the regional PTMA.\", \"fr\": \"3.      Je n’ai pas demandé que ma demande soit traitée en priorité par rapport à d’autres candidats, car je comprends que ma demande sera évaluée dans l’ordre où elle a été reçue par l’AFAC et/ou l’ARPT régional.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-7\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"4.      I have disclosed below any relationships, positive or negative biases, or circumstances that may create a real or perceived conflict of interest.\", \"fr\": \"4.      J’ai divulgué ci-dessous toute relation, biais positif ou négatif, ou circonstance pouvant créer un conflit d’intérêts réel ou perçu.\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body\"}, {\"id\": \"conflict-of-interest\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Please select an option\", \"fr\": \"Veuillez sélectionner une option\"}, \"name\": \"conflict_of_interest\", \"type\": \"radio\", \"class\": \"govuk-radios\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"I confirm that\", \"fr\": \"Je confirme que\"}, \"options\": [{\"label\": {\"en\": \"I have no conflicts of interest or biases to declare \", \"fr\": \"Je n’ai aucun conflit d’intérêts ou biais à déclarer \"}, \"value\": \"no_conflict\"}, {\"label\": {\"en\": \"I wish to declare the following potential conflicts or biases\", \"fr\": \"Je souhaite déclarer les conflits ou biais potentiels suivants\"}, \"value\": \"conflict\", \"children\": [{\"id\": \"2022-conflict-follow\", \"type\": \"textarea\", \"class\": \"govuk-textarea\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Please declare your potential conflict(s) and/or bias(es)\", \"fr\": \"Please declare your potential conflict(s) and/or bias(es)\"}, \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"2022_conflict_follow\"}]}], \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"storageKey\": \"conflict_of_interest\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--s\"}, {\"id\": \"conflict-applicant-signature\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"Enter your full legal name then press Sign.\", \"fr\": \"Entrez votre nom légal complet puis appuyez sur Signer.\"}, \"type\": \"signature-ack\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Type your full name to sign\", \"fr\": \"Tapez votre nom complet pour signer\"}, \"required\": true, \"normalize\": \"none\", \"boxPadding\": \"m\", \"clearLabel\": {\"en\": \"Clear\", \"fr\": \"Effacer\"}, \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"storageKey\": \"conflict_applicant_signature\", \"actionLabel\": {\"en\": \"Sign now\", \"fr\": \"Signer maintenant\"}, \"placeholder\": {\"en\": \"First Last\", \"fr\": \"Prénom Nom\"}, \"handwritingFont\": \"cursive\", \"statusSignedText\": {\"en\": \"Signed\", \"fr\": \"Signé\"}, \"statusUnsignedText\": {\"en\": \"Unsigned\", \"fr\": \"Non signé\"}}], \"nextStepId\": \"social-insurance-number\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Social Insurance Number\", \"fr\": \"Social Insurance Number\"}, \"stepId\": \"social-insurance-number\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"social-insurance-number\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"We need your Social Insurance Number to process your request. It will only be used to confirm your eligibility and won’t be shared without your permission.  Your 9-digit Social Insurance Number (e.g., 123 456 789)\", \"fr\": \"Nous avons besoin de votre numéro d\'assurance sociale pour traiter votre demande. Il ne sera utilisé qu\'à des fins de confirmation de votre éligibilité et ne sera pas partagé sans votre autorisation. Votre numéro d\'assurance sociale de 9 chiffres (par exemple, 123 456 789)\"}, \"mask\": \"sin-ca\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What is your Social Insurance Number (SIN)?\", \"fr\": \"Quel est votre numéro d\'assurance sociale (SIN) ?\"}, \"required\": true, \"inputMode\": \"numeric\", \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--m\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"storageKey\": \"social-insurance-number\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true, \"requiredMessage\": {\"en\": \"Please enter you SIN number\", \"fr\": \"French version\"}}}], \"nextStepId\": \"name\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Name\", \"fr\": \"Name\"}, \"stepId\": \"name\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"paragraph\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"What is your name?\", \"fr\": \"Quel est votre nom?\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}, {\"id\": \"paragraph-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Enter your full legal name. This should match the name on your identification documents.\", \"fr\": \"Exemple e texte\"}, \"type\": \"paragraph\", \"class\": \"govuk-body-l\"}, {\"id\": \"first-name\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"First Name\", \"fr\": \"Premier Nom\"}, \"required\": true, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"storageKey\": \"first-name\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true}, \"autocomplete\": \"given-name\"}, {\"id\": \"last-name\", \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Last Name\", \"fr\": \"Nom de Famille\"}, \"required\": true, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"storageKey\": \"last-name\", \"validation\": {\"required\": true}, \"autocomplete\": \"family-name\"}, {\"id\": \"middle-names\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"optional\", \"fr\": \"facultatif\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Middle Name(s)\", \"fr\": \"Nom de milieu(s)\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"storageKey\": \"middle-names\", \"autocomplete\": \"additional-name\"}, {\"id\": \"preferred-name\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"optional\", \"fr\": \"facultatif\"}, \"type\": \"input\", \"class\": \"govuk-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"Preferred Name (if different)\", \"fr\": \"Nom préféré (si différent)\"}, \"required\": false, \"inputType\": \"text\", \"normalize\": \"trim\", \"labelClass\": \"govuk-label--s\", \"spellcheck\": false, \"storageKey\": \"preferred-name\", \"autocomplete\": \"nickname\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"date-of-birth\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schema\", \"title\": {\"en\": \"Date of Birth\", \"fr\": \"Date of Birth\"}, \"stepId\": \"date-of-birth\", \"components\": [{\"id\": \"dob\", \"hint\": {\"en\": \"For example, 27 3 2007.  If you don\'t know it, leave it blank.\", \"fr\": \"Par exemple, 27 3 2007\"}, \"type\": \"date-input\", \"label\": {\"en\": \"What is your date of birth?\", \"fr\": \"Entrez la date\"}, \"required\": false, \"normalize\": \"date-iso\", \"dateFields\": [{\"name\": \"day\", \"classes\": \"govuk-input--width-2\"}, {\"name\": \"month\", \"classes\": \"govuk-input--width-2\"}, {\"name\": \"year\", \"classes\": \"govuk-input--width-4\"}], \"storageKey\": \"dob\", \"legendClass\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\"}], \"nextStepId\": \"gender\", \"description\": {\"en\": \"\", \"fr\": \"\"}}, {\"type\": \"schem